t/501423/5014230316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/501423/5014230315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/501423/5014230314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/501423/5014230313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/501423/5014230312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Shaily Engineering Plastics reported its operational and financial performance for Q2 and H1 FY27, highlighting revenue growth driven by the healthcare segment despite weaker market demand for home furnishings in Europe and USA. The company secured business confirmations for Semaglutide pens supply and announced plans to set up a medical devices manufacturing facility in Abu Dhabi. Management also launched the Shaily AI Toby Reusable auto-injector platform and reported an upgrade in short-term bank facility ratings by CARE Ratings. Shaily Engineering Plastics reported its Q1 FY27 financial and operational performance, highlighting strong growth in its healthcare segment driven by pen injector platforms and regulatory approvals for Semaglutide in Canada and Brazil. The consumer segment faced headwinds from softer demand in Europe and the United States, while the industrial segment maintained a healthy growth trajectory.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management stated that the company expects to go beyond 36 million pens for the full year.","quote":"Short answer is we should be.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The company observed improved traction in the healthcare segment as the key driver for overall business growth.","quote":"Improved traction in the healthcare segment has been the key driver for the overall growth of the business","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7c823f72-77ee-4195-8f43-7bf922bca3a2.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that the consumer segment performance reflected softer demand in home furnishings across Europe and the United States.","quote":"Performance reflected softer demand in home furnishings across Europe and United States, our largest export markets for the business.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted weaker market demand for home furnishings across Europe and USA.","quote":"Weaker Market Demand for Home Furnishings across Europe & USA","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=60cea666-6162-4b30-ac78-7c3df246fe15.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The new facility in Abu Dhabi is expected to add a capacity of 75 million pens annually.","quote":"\u2022 This facility is expected to add a capacity of 75 Mn pens annually","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7c823f72-77ee-4195-8f43-7bf922bca3a2.pdf"},{"claim":"Management announced that an additional 25 million pen capacity is expected to become operational by the end of September.","quote":"As committed earlier, our additional 25 million pen capacity is expected to become operational by end of September, taking our total installed pen injector capacity to approximately 75 million pens per annum.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the Abu Dhabi plant is supposed to start commercial sales by the end of FY28.","quote":"The plant is supposed to start selling by end of FY28.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"},{"claim":"Management mentioned an investment of INR5 crores in the existing facility for semiconductor trays.","quote":"Semiconductor Trays, I think we have mentioned that we are looking at investing about INR5 crores in our existing facility, which would meet initial requirements.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the investment for the Consumer Electronics plant down south would be between INR80 crores to INR100 crores.","quote":"On Consumer Electronics, again, we have said that once we set up a plant down south, we would be looking at an investment of somewhere between INR80 crores to INR100 crores in that facility.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management expects gross margins to return to normalized levels by quarter 3.","quote":"We expect that the gross margin would come back to normalized level by quarter 3.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"},{"claim":"Management reported that EBITDA stood at INR83 crores with an EBITDA margin improvement of 120 bps to 29.7%.","quote":"EBITDA stood at INR83 crores from INR70 crores, reflecting a growth of 18%, while EBITDA margin improved by 120 bps to 29.7%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Business confirmation was received for the supply of Semaglutide pens.","quote":"Business confirmation received for Semaglutide pens supply by the company","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7c823f72-77ee-4195-8f43-7bf922bca3a2.pdf"},{"claim":"25 million pens capacity is expected to be added.","quote":"25 Mn Pens capacity is expected to be added","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7c823f72-77ee-4195-8f43-7bf922bca3a2.pdf"},{"claim":"Automation machines were received and are currently under the commissioning and validation stage.","quote":"Automation machines received, currently under commissioning and validation stage","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=7c823f72-77ee-4195-8f43-7bf922bca3a2.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that machine utilization improved to 50.2% during Q1 FY27 compared with 48.7% in Q1 FY26.","quote":"Machine utilization improved to 50.2% during Q1 FY27 compared with 48.7% in Q1 FY26, reflecting a gradual improvement in capacity utilization.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"},{"claim":"Management reported that 6 of their 8 device platforms are now fully commercial.","quote":"6 of our 8 device platforms are now fully commercial and sold across global markets, developed within 7 to 8 years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=92a94c7e-046a-4e10-8f7e-3e1da20a2a85.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management noted that the global operating environment remained challengin